A mummy wrapping is the commonest way to enter shops once you are
invisible. Some more obscure methods are:
* teleport in with control and out,
* jump diagonally through the door,
* hurtle diagonally through the door by throwing things (e.g. rocks)
while levitating,
* dig down with a pick-axe on the level above to (hopefully) fall into
the shop, and leave by digging down on an empty square after paying,
* instead of entering, use a pet and a magic whistle to steal stuff,
* have a digging monster (dwarf with pick-axe/mattock; umber
hulk, ...) dig a hole for you to enter
* raze the closed shop door with a wand of digging, enter/leave, then
pay for the damage, (risky!)


